plore/librarian agents for better results:  \n    \n  ```  \n  // Parallel exploration - fire multiple agents simultaneously  \n  task(agent=\"explore\", prompt=\"Find all files matching pattern X\")  \n  task(agent=\"explore\", prompt=\"Search for implementation of Y\")   \n  task(agent=\"librarian\", prompt=\"Lookup documentation for Z\")  \n    \n  // Then continue your work while they run in background  \n  // System will notify you when each completes  \n  ```  \n    \n  WHY:  \n  - Agents can perform deeper, more thorough searches  \n  - Background tasks run in parallel, saving time  \n  - Specialized agents have domain expertise  \n  - Reduces context window usage in main session  \n    \n  ALWAYS prefer: Multiple parallel task calls > Direct tool calls  \n\n\n  ✱ Glob \"**/*5-8*\"  \n  └─ output  \n  Found 1 file(s)  \n    \n  /root/Projects/Ling/AgentLoomAUTO/_bmad-output/implementation-artifacts/story-5-8-universal-session-abstraction-and-tool-execution-state-machine.md  \n  [Agent Usage Reminder]  \n    \n  You called a search/fetch tool directly without leveraging specialized agents.  \n    \n  RECOMMENDED: Use task with explore/librarian agents for better results:  \n    \n  ```  \n  // Parallel exploration - fire multiple agents simultaneously  \n  task(agent=\"explore\", prompt=\"Find all files matching pattern X\")  \n  task(agent=\"explore\", prompt=\"Search for implementation of Y\")   \n  task(agent=\"librarian\", prompt=\"Lookup documentation for Z\")  \n    \n  // Then continue your work while they run in background  \n  // System will notify you when each completes  \n  ```  \n    \n  WHY:  \n  - Agents can perform deeper, more thorough searches  \n  - Background tasks run in parallel, saving time  \n  - Specialized agents have domain expertise  \n  - Reduces context window usage in main session  \n    \n  ALWAYS prefer: Multiple parallel task calls > Direct tool calls  \n\n\n  ┃  Thinking: I found the story file. Let me read it now and also gather context about the existing codebase structure for the relevant modules. Let me fire parallel explorations while reading the story file.  \n\n\n  → Read /root/Projects/Ling/AgentLoomAUTO/_bmad-output/implementation-artifacts/story-5-8-universal-session-abstraction-and-tool-execution-state-machine.md  \n  └─ output  \n  <path>/root/Projects/Ling/AgentLoomAUTO/_bmad-output/implementation-artifacts/story-5-8-universal-session-abstraction-and-tool-execution-state-machine.md</path>  \n  <type>file</type>  \n  <content>1: # Story 5.8: Universal Session 抽象与 Tool Execution State Machine  \n  2:   \n  3: ## Story 信息  \n  4:   \n  5: | 字段 | 值 |  \n  6: |------|-----|  \n  7: | Story ID | 5.8 |  \n  8: | Epic | Epic 5 — 工作流执行引擎 |  \n  9: | 优先级 | MVP — Must Have |  \n  10: | 估算点数 | 13 |  \n  11: | 状态 | backlog |  \n  12: | 前置依赖 | Story 3.7 (统一 Agent 执行节点), Story 5.1 (ExecutionInstance 持久化与队列调度) |  \n  13: | FR 覆盖 | FR75 (Universal Session 抽象), FR76 (Tool Execution State Machine) |  \n  14: | 不包含 | MCP Runtime Client 持久连接 (独立 Story), 会话历史 UI 完整渲染 (Story 5.9+), Sandbox 适配器工具执行 (SandboxAgentAdapter 相关) |  \n  15:   \n  16: ## 目标与用户价值  \n  17:   \n  18: **As a** 执行引擎开发者,  \n  19: **I want** 统一的 Session 抽象层为工作流模式和会话模式提供一致的接口，以及显式的 Tool Execution 状态机来管理工具调用的完整生命周期,  \n  20: **So that** 工具执行的权限控制、暂停/恢复、事件推送和审计追踪可以在同一套基础设施中完成，无需为不同模式分别实现。  \n  21:   \n  22: ## 描述  \n  23:   \n  24: 本 Story 实现两大核心能力：  \n  25:   \n  26: 1. **Universal Session 抽象**: 将当前 InProcessAgentAdapter 和 SandboxAgentAdapter 中各自独立的 `Map<string, AgentSession>` 内存存储，统一为通过 `checkpointData` JSONB 持久化的 Session 管理机制。工作流模式绑定 execution context（executionId + stepId），会话模式绑定 conversationId（本 Story 提供接口，conversation 端具体实现留给后续 Story）。两种模式共享相同的 `AgentSession` 接口、`SessionContext`（含 ContentBlock[] history）和生命周期管理。  \n  27:   \n  28: 2. **Tool Execution State Machine**: 将当前仅为类型定义的 `ToolCallStatus`（pending → awaiting_permission → denied/in_progress → completed/failed）升级为有服务端强制校验的状态机。处理 AgentTaskWorker 中尚未实现的 `tool_use` stop reason，在工具调用每次状态转换时持久化事件记录并通过 WebSocket 广播，前端可实时展示工具执行轨迹。  \n  29:   \n  30: ### 现有基础设施（已实现，本 Story 不需重复实现）  \n  31:   \n  32: **Server 侧已完成：**  \n  33: - `AgentSession` 类型定义: `{id, agentId, mode(workflow|conversation), context:SessionContext, status(active|paused|completed|error), tenantId?, llmModelConfigId?, systemPrompt?, autonomyMode?, createdAt, updatedAt}`  \n  34: - `SessionContext` 类型定义: `{history:ContentBlock[], cwd?, mcpServers?, workflowState?}`  \n  35: - `ToolCallStatus` 类型枚举: `pending|awaiting_permission|denied|in_progress|completed|failed`  \n  36: - `ToolCallEvent` 类型定义: `{id, tool, args, status, result?, error?, permissionRequest?:{description, resourcePaths?}}`  \n  37: - `StopReason` 类型枚举: `end_turn|max_tokens|tool_use|cancelled|intervention_required`  \n  38: - `AgentEvent` 联合类型: `PlanEvent|MessageChunkEvent|ToolCallAgentEvent|DecisionEvent|DoneEvent`（含类型守卫）  \n  39: - `ContentBlock` 5 种变体: `text|image|audio|resource|resource_link`（Zod schema + 类型守卫）  \n  40: - `IAgentRuntime` 接口: `createSession/loadSession/prompt/cancel`（已定义 Symbol `AGENT_RUNTIME`）  \n  41: - `StepStateMachineService`: 执行步骤级别 FSM（与工具调用 FSM 不同层级）  \n  42: - `execution_steps.checkpointData` JSONB: 已存储 `sessionId`  \n  43: - `EventBridgeService → ThrottleService → broadcastTypedEvent()` 管线: 支持自定义事件推送  \n  44: - `ExecutionEvent<T>` 信封: 含 monotonic eventId，支持断线重连回放  \n  45:   \n  46: **Studio 侧已完成：**  \n  47: - `StepStatus` 类型含所有步骤状态  \n  48: - `NodeExecutionOverlay`: 各状态的视觉样式  \n  49: - `executionStore`: `NodeExecutionState` per nodeId，含 status/progress/error  \n  50: - `useExecutionSocket`: WebSocket 事件监听基础设施  \n  51: - `ExecutionEventName` 枚举: 已有 `NODE_STATUS_CHANGED`, `NODE_AGENT_EVENT` 等  \n  52:   \n  53: ### 本 Story 需要填补的 GAP  \n  54:   \n  55: **Server 侧 GAP：**  \n  56: 1. **Session 持久化**: 两个适配器均使用 `Map<string, AgentSession>` 内存存储，进程重启后 session 丢失；无 `SessionRepository` 或持久化策略  \n  57: 2. **Session 创建/加载统一**: `IAgentRuntime.createSession/loadSession` 已定义接口但两个适配器各自实现，无共享的 session 生命周期管理  \n  58: 3. **`tool_use` stop reason 未处理**: `AgentTaskWorker` 未处理 `DoneEvent.stopReason === 'tool_use'`，工具调用无法执行  \n  59: 4. **ToolCallStatus FSM 仅为类型**: `ToolCallStatus` 是纯类型枚举，无服务端转换校验、无持久化、无审计  \n  60: 5. **Tool 权限流程无服务端执行**: `awaiting_permission` 状态存在但无 API 端点解决权限请求  \n  61: 6. **工具调用事件未广播**: 工具调用的状态变更未通过 WebSocket 推送到前端  \n  62:   \n  63: **Studio 侧 GAP：**  \n  64: 1. **Agent 事件类型未解析**: `StepAgentEventPayload.event` 为 `unknown` 类型，收到后静默丢弃  \n  65: 2. **无工具执行可视化**: 无组件展示工具调用轨迹、状态、输入输出  \n  66: 3. **executionStore 无 agent 事件状态**: `NodeExecutionState` 不包含 `agentEvents` 或 `toolCalls` 数据  \n  67: 4. **无工具调用 WebSocket 事件处理**: 未注册 tool-call 相关事件监听器  \n  68:   \n  69: ## 验收标准  \n  70:   \n  71: ### AC-1: 工作流模式创建统一 AgentSession  \n  72:   \n  73: ```gherkin  \n  74: Given 工作流执行到达一个 Agent 节点  \n  75: When AgentTaskWorker 处理该步骤  \n  76: Then 通过 IAgentRuntime.createSession() 创建 AgentSession  \n  77:   And session.mode === 'workflow'  \n  78:   And session.context.workflowState 包含 {executionId, stepId, nodeId}  \n  79:   And session 序列化持久化到 execution_steps.checkpointData.session  \n  80: ```  \n  81:   \n  82: ### AC-2: Session 从 checkpoint 恢复  \n  83:   \n  84: ```gherkin  \n  85: Given 某执行步骤的 checkpointData 包含已序列化的 session 数据  \n  86\n... (truncated, 465579 more chars)\n    at runWorkflow (/root/Projects/Ling/AutoBMAD/dist/cli.js:8297:34)\n    at async processStory (/root/Projects/Ling/AutoBMAD/dist/cli.js:8241:31)\n    at async runSprint (/root/Projects/Ling/AutoBMAD/dist/cli.js:8417:60)\n    at async resumeSprint (unknown)\n    at async resumeCommand (unknown)\n    at async runCli (unknown)\n    at processTicksAndRejections (native:7:39)",
      "workflow": "dev-story"
    },
